      "content": "yeah i get the calm approach. but i feel like there's just this underlying vibe sometimes, like there are these invisible rules or little traps set up by the people in charge to just mess with you. i've heard people describe the whole process as feeling like you're being scrutinized by something not quite human or just being toyed with by some kind of mischievous force. can you explain if there's any logic to that kind of behavior or is it just random?",
